{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51364","headline":"黄鹤楼 · 贾岛","name":"黄鹤楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高槛危檐势若飞，孤云野水共依依。\n青山万古长如旧，黄鹤何年去不归。\n岸映西山（一作「州」）城半山，烟生南浦树将微。\n定知羽客无因见，空使含情对落晖。\n（《古今图书集成·职方典》一一二五《武昌府部》（民国《湖北通志》卷一○一《金石》九录《鄂州杂诗碑》，分五层，录谢朓及唐人诗三十九首，其中即贾岛此诗及本书後录之卢郢诗。\n碑署「熙宁二年六月□日额立」，不着书人姓名，清代尚存於黄鹤楼後斗姥阁西壁。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}